    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🤔❓</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>你有没有在图书馆里偶然发现过什么意想不到的宝藏？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你有没有哪本摄影集中的照片背后的故事，让你感到特别有共鸣？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Willy Ronis</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjn6g6b7PsfTazwEldgVgvktwVRJ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg1wGRjpJEoiKRJgmcIkgyRy9hbc.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lunP32DMDwliKPtz8N4W_xFDnK32.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期图片来源：《那一天》（法语读作：Ce jour-là）的摄影集，豆瓣评分8.4分</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlmCKJyyr24O1pR1DFC7QrPJVj6W.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期摄影作品：马克斯小屋，桥连城，1947</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm4ADCECZIr9xQEmHC7OOG27kUNv.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
